{"seq":29,"slug":"ecommerce-catalog-pim","title":"电商商品目录与 PIM 系统","stage":"DONE","category":"ecommerce","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim","rating":{"composite":3.91,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"电商商品目录与-pim-系统\">电商商品目录与 PIM 系统</h1><p>商品目录（Product Catalog）是电商平台的数据地基——它定义了「卖什么」以及「用什么结构描述」。当 SKU 数量从数百膨胀到数百万、销售渠道从单站扩展到全渠道时，手工维护的 Excel 和分散在各系统中的产品数据将不可避免地产生不一致、不完整和更新延迟。Product Information Management（PIM）系统应运而生，充当商品数据的单一可信源（Single Source of Truth），将采集、建模、治理、丰富和分发统一到一个可编排的生命周期中。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦<strong>目录数据基础设施</strong>——从底层数据模型、分类体系，到 PIM 平台架构、数据质量治理、多渠道分发，再到支撑发现体验的分面导航与索引策略，以及大规模运营所需的批量导入、版本控制和国际化能力。我们关注的是「数据如何组织、流转和治理」，而非搜索排序算法或推荐模型本身。</p>\n<p>与相邻 hub 的分工：<code>ecommerce-search-ranking</code> 深入检索排序的信号工程与算法调优；<code>ecommerce-recommendation</code> 聚焦协同过滤与实时推荐策略。本 hub 为它们提供上游数据基础——高质量、结构化的商品元数据是检索与推荐效果的先决条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节结构\">章节结构</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>foundations</strong>：目录架构总览、商品数据建模、分类与分面体系设计</li>\n<li><strong>pim-systems</strong>：PIM 平台架构、数据质量与丰富化、多渠道内容分发</li>\n<li><strong>search-discovery</strong>：分面导航实现、目录搜索索引、商品推荐数据管线</li>\n<li><strong>scale-operations</strong>：批量导入与 ETL、目录版本治理、国际化与本地化</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"目录基础架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"catalog-architecture-overview","title":"商品目录架构总览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/foundations/catalog-architecture-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"product-data-modeling","title":"商品数据建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/foundations/product-data-modeling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"category-taxonomy","title":"分类与分面体系设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/foundations/category-taxonomy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"pim-systems","title":"PIM 系统核心","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/pim-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pim-architecture","title":"PIM 平台架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/pim-systems/pim-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-quality-enrichment","title":"数据质量与丰富化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/pim-systems/data-quality-enrichment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-channel-syndication","title":"多渠道内容分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/pim-systems/multi-channel-syndication"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"search-discovery","title":"搜索与发现","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/search-discovery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"faceted-navigation","title":"分面导航实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/search-discovery/faceted-navigation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"catalog-search-indexing","title":"目录搜索索引构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/search-discovery/catalog-search-indexing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"product-recommendations","title":"商品推荐数据管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/search-discovery/product-recommendations"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"scale-operations","title":"规模化运营","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/scale-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bulk-import-etl","title":"批量导入与 ETL 管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/scale-operations/bulk-import-etl"},{"seq":2,"slug":"catalog-versioning-governance","title":"目录版本控制与治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/scale-operations/catalog-versioning-governance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"internationalization-localization","title":"国际化与本地化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/scale-operations/internationalization-localization"}]}]}